              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Koinak ŋesi kere, ludidik ka lukapolok, lukabarak ka lukican, luijakakaete, ka ibulesin da, aibwaikinio emacar akanikec nakoteten, arai bo oreetakec, ",
          "type": "text",
